<title>UK: IBCA rates DSL Bank notes due 2001.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates DSL Bank notes due 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European rating agency, said on Tuesday it had assigned a long-term rating of AAA to DSL Bank Deutsche Siedlungs-und Landesrentenbank's (DSL Bank) $300 million 6.25 percent notes due 2001.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied Federal German guarantee for the obligations of DSL Bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statment.</p>
<p>--International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
